INSERT INTO task_runs VALUES('run-f803993387','task-fe38324f51',1788288441.20545244,'{"task_id": "task-fe38324f51", "run_id": "run-f803993387", "started_at": 1788288441.2054524, "finished_at": 1788288776.391694, "status": "ok", "result_text": "\n\nRun complete. The `applied-2026-09-01.md` output exists with all three attempts recorded and `ledger.md` appended.\n\n## What I filed this run\n\n**1 sent \u2014 actually out the door:**\n- **Sprinter Health \u2014 Machine Learning Engineer** (Ashby ATS). Filled Name, Email, uploaded the resume. The page confirmed *\"Your application was successfully submitted.\"* Note: it''s **Hybrid in SF ($140\u2013200K)** \u2014 not the remote role the shortlist implied \u2014 and the form had **no cover-letter box**, so the tailored draft had nowhere to go. The application stands on the resume.\n\n**1 blocked \u2014 my call, yours to review:**\n- **Cambridge ERA:AI Fellowship** (the deadline-priority pick). The Airtable form has a required certification: *\"I confirm that I will not be using LLMs\u2026 to complete this application,\"* with a clause stating AI use gets you disqualified. Since an AI assistant drafted this, filing it would put a **false certification in your name**. I stopped rather than certify that. Second independent blocker: the form wants 2 references (Name/Email/Role) that aren''t in `facts.md`. If you want it, you must write the essays by hand.\n\n**1 skipped:**\n- **Hyro \u2014 Senior AI Engineer:** the posting is **no longer open** \u2014 hyro.ai/careers/ now lists 5 different roles. No Senior AI Engineer anywhere.\n\n**Grants:** reviewed `grants.md` \u2014 nothing fileable by a web form this run. The rolling no-entity opportunities (Leo Gao, Corrigibility, IFP, fal.ai) need your own authored writing; the SBIR money needs incorporation + SAM.gov + UEI.\n\n## The most useful output \u2014 \"needs an answer from me\"\n1. **ERA:AI LLM-prohibition decision** \u2014 the single gate on the top pick. Write it by hand \u2192 unblocks it.\n2. **Two reference contacts** (Name/Email/Role) \u2014 needed for ERA:AI and any standard role that asks.\n3. **Passport valid to 26 Sep 2027** (ERA:AI logistics gate \u2014 12 days out).\n\nThe full audit trail, quoted free-text, and employer-facing notes are here: [applied-2026-09-01.md](applied-2026-09-01.md)", "artifacts": ["ledger.md", "applied-2026-09-01.md", "screenshots/sprinter-preview.png"], "error": null, "trigger": "catchup", "session_id": "__run__run-f803993387"}');
